WEBVTT

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:01.415
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:03.733 --> 00:00:05.310
<v><b>A:</b></v> How much is this mug?

00:00:05.951 --> 00:00:07.533
<v><b>B:</b></v> It’s £9.

00:00:10.746 --> 00:00:11.287
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:13.565 --> 00:00:14.909
<v><b>A:</b></v> How much is that cap?

00:00:15.693 --> 00:00:17.117
<v><b>B:</b></v> It’s £12.

00:00:20.231 --> 00:00:20.856
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:23.148 --> 00:00:25.159
<v><b>A:</b></v> How much are these plates?

00:00:25.779 --> 00:00:27.483
<v><b>B:</b></v> They’re £15.

00:00:30.558 --> 00:00:31.228
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:33.428 --> 00:00:35.286
<v><b>A:</b></v> How much are those T-shirts?

00:00:35.886 --> 00:00:37.344
<v><b>B:</b></v> They’re £20.

00:00:40.532 --> 00:00:41.236
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:43.515 --> 00:00:44.837
<v><b>A:</b></v> Two caps, please.

00:00:45.517 --> 00:00:47.452
<v><b>B:</b></v> That’s £24.